           "html": "<h5><strong>Approach</strong></h5>",
           "keepLast": false,
           "classes": [
            "font_line_height_1-2"
           ],
           "style": {}
          },
          {
           "type": "html",
           "html": "<p>We built a modular brand system (type Centra No.2 + Neue Haas Grotesk, electric blue with mint/black/white/light‑gray accents), clear safe‑zone rules and logo variants (horizontal logotype, isotype/imagotype) for flexibility.</p><p>We translated the identity into a fast, intuitive website (clear navigation, large‑scale visuals, subtle micro‑interactions, AA accessibility) that strengthens the connection to digital construction solutions.</p>",
           "keepLast": false,
           "classes": [],
           "style": {}
